{"sha": "ce47252a2299466e67a173d5d23e453cea9386f6e4529af190102d837ee00918", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "正反馈：饱和。若 $V_s = +V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$，则 $V_+ =", "\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$，且 $\\epsilon = \\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}} - V_e$", "保持为正，直到 $V_e$ 超过 $\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$；此时", "输出翻转，$V_+$ 降至 $-\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$，新状态", "保持到 $V_e$ 降至该值以下。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\node[op amp] (s) at (0,0) {};", "  \\draw (s.-) -- ++(-0.8,0) node[left] {$V_e$};", "  \\draw (s.out) -- ++(0.6,0) node[right] {$V_s$};", "  \\coordinate (j) at ($(s.+)+(-0.6,0)$);", "  \\coordinate (f) at ($(j)+(0,-1.0)$);", "  \\coordinate (o) at ($(s.out)+(0.3,0)$);", "  \\draw (s.+) -- (j);", "  \\draw (o) -- (o |- f) to[R=$R_2$] (f) -- (j);", "  \\draw (f) to[R=$R_1$] ++(0,-1.6) node[ground]{};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.8cm, yshift=-0.9cm]", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, width=6.4cm, height=4.6cm, xlabel={$V_e$}, ylabel={$V_s$},", "      xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north},", "      xmin=-2.2, xmax=2.2, ymin=-1.5, ymax=1.5, xtick={-1,1}, xticklabels={$-\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$,$\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$},", "      ytick={-1,1}, yticklabels={$-V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$,$+V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$}, anchor=origin, at={(0,0)}]", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, -Stealth] (axis cs:-2.2,1) -- (axis cs:0.2,1);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick] (axis cs:0.2,1) -- (axis cs:1,1) -- (axis cs:1,-1);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, -Stealth] (axis cs:2.2,-1) -- (axis cs:-0.2,-1);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick] (axis cs:-0.2,-1) -- (axis cs:-1,-1) -- (axis cs:-1,1);", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 施密特触发器：经 $R_1$、$R_2$ 的正反馈", "给出两个阈值 $\\pm\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$。输出", "在 $V_e$ 上升超过上阈值时由高变低，", "在下降至下阈值以下时由低变高（箭头所示），形成一个滞回循环。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[弛豫振荡器]\\label{ex:b1:operational-amplifier:astable}", "\\index{弛豫振荡器}", "将施密特触发器的输出接回其自身的反相输入端，", "经 $R$ 接入，并将 $C$ 从 $V_-$ 接至地。", "电容器向 $\\pm V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$ 充电，每次达到", "$\\pm\\beta V_{\\mathrm{sat}}$ 时使触发器翻转：输出为方波，", "电容器电压为一串指数弧段，周期为", "\\[", "T = 2RC\\ln\\frac{1 + \\beta}{1 - \\beta}", "\\]", "(见\\cref{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:12})：$2.2\\,RC$，对应 $\\beta = \\tfrac12$。", "无输入、一个电容器和一个时钟——一个系统，", "因无法稳定而振荡，这一主题将在", "本科二年级分册的反馈振荡器中再次出现。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:1}", "同相放大器中 $R_1 = \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm}$，$R_2 =", "\\qty{9.0}{k\\ohm}$，$V_{\\mathrm{sat}} = \\qty{15}{V}$。求增益？", "当 $V_e = \\qty{0.50}{V}$ 时的输出？饱和前的最大输入为多少？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:2}", "反相放大器中 $R_1 = \\qty{10}{k\\ohm}$，$R_2 = \\qty{100}{k\\ohm}$。", "求增益、输入阻抗、从 \\qty{1.0}{V} 电源汲取的电流以及输出。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:3}", "一个内阻为 \\qty{10}{k\\ohm}、开路电压为", "\\qty{1.0}{V} 的传感器需驱动一个 \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm} 的负载。", "在两者之间不接和接入跟随器两种情况下，负载两端的电压各为多少？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:4}", "求和放大器中 $R_f = \\qty{10}{k\\ohm}$，两输入端分别经", "\\qty{10}{k\\ohm} 和 \\qty{20}{k\\ohm} 接入。写出 $V_s$；并计算", "$V_1 = \\qty{1.0}{V}$、$V_2 = \\qty{2.0}{V}$ 时的值。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:5}", "推导差分放大器的 $V_s = (R_2/R_1)(V_2 - V_1)$。取", "$R_1 = \\qty{10}{k\\ohm}$，$R_2 = \\qty{100}{k\\ohm}$，$V_1 = \\qty{1.00}{V}$，", "$V_2 = \\qty{1.05}{V}$：求输出？两输入端共有的", "\\qty{1}{V} 电压发生了什么变化？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:6}", "积分器中 $R = \\qty{10}{k\\ohm}$，$C = \\qty{100}{nF}$，输出", "初始为零。施加一个 \\qty{1.0}{V} 阶跃：求输出的斜率，", "以及达到饱和（\\qty{15}{V}）所需的时间。施加一个 \\qty{1.0}{kHz} 的方波，", "幅值为 $\\pm\\qty{1.0}{V}$：求输出的形状与振幅。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:7}", "在前述积分器的电容器两端并联一个 \\qty{1.0}{M\\ohm} 的电阻。", "求传递函数、直流增益、截止频率，", "以及 \\qty{1.0}{kHz} 处的增益；", "该电路在哪一频率范围内仍能积分？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:8}", "设计一个反相有源低通滤波器，使其通带增益为 \\qty{20}{dB}，", "截止频率为 \\qty{500}{Hz}，并取 $R_1 = \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:operational-amplifier:9}", "一个实际放大器的 $\\mu_0 = 10^5$，$f_T = \\qty{1.0}{MHz}$。对于设计增益为", "$100$ 的同相放大器：求实际直流增益", "（分析中保留有限的 $\\mu_0$），以及带宽；", "跟随器的带宽是多少？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}